  "description": "A dragon born in Gyebong! Yeon Seo-Ha! \n\nShe returned to Gyebong as a loach. Seo-Ha, who came to Seoul with big dreams, is caught up in repeated workplace troubles and even a rental scam. On her first night back in Gyebong, as if being chased, she encounters Do Ji-Tae, the older brother of her friend she had a crush on, naked in the shower room after a beer. She goes to a fortune teller, desperate for advice, and the words of a Bodhisattva come to mind.\n\n“You need to meet a man with more virility than me, Unnie. You will shine in that man’s big, hot dick.”\n\nSeo-Ha swallowed hard and desperately grabbed Ji-Tae’s hands, pleading.\n\n *“You’re the only one who can save me. Just put it in for a moment, okay?”*\n\n(Source: Naver Series, translated)",
